# The egress's Tor client (docs/EGRESS.md, "Tor"). WLO, WML, WTC and WCY wall every address outside Poland
# (Imperva rules on their plan directories), so only Polish exits are any use.
ExitNodes {pl}
StrictNodes 1
# One port per circuit: streams on different SocksPorts never share one, so each is a separate pool entry.
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9051
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9052
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9053
# Only the compose networks (the egress); everything else is refused.
SocksPolicy accept 10.0.0.0/8
SocksPolicy accept 172.16.0.0/12
SocksPolicy accept 192.168.0.0/16
SocksPolicy reject *
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
AvoidDiskWrites 1
Log notice stdout
